{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1380,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fde4f64294b990cea5042c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，要开始训练啰。\r\n快，你快准备呼喊口号！\r\n你要负责带起圣王的情绪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9947217aad510edb222974f08af3806b9d3237880e108e4690dd9963902998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3b7aaccaa6fe186512a5ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要缔造好成绩粉丝自然不离不弃，\r\n我总是把眼光放在更高的目标。\r\n圣王就该永远抬头看向远方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c40be814a38782276e9f75af783cfe89559281bd6719e653e88ad6ef813977",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43a91f46ae4033bc9a32c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "影片拍好后待会也让我看看。\r\n我想确认自己的舞步，\r\n镜子跟影片看起来感觉完全不同呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e429e4e3122f5598da406ed603eacbff60298c6cfed0032a1d557bbed4b7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fea18cd0a01647b21727e0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观众的眼光可是很残酷的。\r\n我得好好表现，让大家看见\r\n我是个值得支持的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75574e792cbff2c8acc98d8cf94770eb3f0a0911b512558f1ae38f7c966b45f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:819ed7c4b6fe0a4359fd26ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论身处何处，我都要\r\n用自身的光彩让当下辉煌。\r\n为此得先好好练习对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d23390429b4a555356c524c62da00a97c1c1793339822d3b974afc0a28ca92fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef369f613c093bfb0b84a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种强劲只能在一路都\r\n深受声援的选手身上看到……\r\n所以我才会想获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b218eca141deac361fed830844f02308cd5cdf9146da6d8c3d370e8f5ca08b25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cda322632bf70a8376e0155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些话只有一直在我身边的人才\r\n说得出来吧？要是想声援我，\r\n就说些配得上圣王的话来听听吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "29e70104cec9acdf56fab5e51a5496fc4b7e97b5bbbf536a48afe6eca4415969",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2764adaaecab36b3cec6eeca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このキングが衣装に着られるなんて\r\nまっぴらごめんよ！\r\nしっかり己を磨かないと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dad0f4ecb3e2363dc9d487897db4e481474a90a33abda9ebc854d41d7c4bfa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd98bd72d61761a1a6257ebd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メイク直しなんて必要ないわ！\r\n私は常に準備は万全なの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a46c54744ede601ba65405936d8f0aed3dec4bd4e26c9448e6cdfd45a62b1579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beecb3e0a260456903c660bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流とは常に完璧であること。\r\n私が満足するまでやるのよ！\r\n付き合いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68571491c0f56b682fdc72cbfad672618852cad6e6c7f78fabc21307e607165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3666b5565791b215da170c71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私を憧れに思ってくれる子が\r\nいるんだもの。期待を裏切らない\r\nように努力を続けないとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee77bdfeb3bbc78b38a48e467eaab6c550be3cf0a7d1d835347c1aeaa1a7f101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb10664ae701ebbd681bddd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい？病める時も健やかなる時も、\r\n一流のトレーナーとして\r\n最高のトレーニングを志しなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44818976f2e671170cdf4e5ff104fa7413dde4d2c5738d456cb5e4c5042d42b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5995c97625386f45956da8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に側にいる人の意見は重要ね。\r\nあなたのおかげで私が『私』を理解\r\nできるようになった気がするもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b790c7b4621b349786fd174ffe3786de5b25cb59d95fbee1402062af7ed219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0542917a5ab67e11e01d8b3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偉業を成し遂げた時には、あなた\r\nにも一言いってもらうから！\r\n今から考えておきなさいよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96e3bd25e3dcd5fd96f33f6fedcc0c6aa3cd33949f97c9e9b08f669fecfce041",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feef0d8216e0979bfbecf812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是堪称一流的结果！你也该感到自豪才对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e8a1d6f8e210c44ee95cecc56686531753181648195b3b4ad96f3b4fd4c6b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee353f1dfb2d85d9894341d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！这就是一流赛马娘的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eede0f43b1bc17224a50eb5f4a6d5e17fe4b5a028084aaa216e160cc4be4327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b50ae1d98e4ee6bf897739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你变成我的粉丝了？\r\n呵呵，你一直都是吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7eda957321b1aa31e962db5a573fc74d30a592edd62cdb16d2ead135936988d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f1bb49576f548f4cb20636",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后也要继续响应加油声喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec39b477abd03bda7f03510045e0e1467e533ba8d127a9d8d1038f37ea7696dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c8966d16406ade33f25219",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流の…最高のエスコートだったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2525b0055d84b6b78eeca3d8785d2e2a99a07fd3160ba6a9083d1127f53529",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4afa4ead1137b083e0562e28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の選んだ結果だもの、満足しているわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bcc94ebfaa036839672b2a999ff1a36a1b1ec5c09186b1dad8098dd7a923534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4361938a1e4f65878660055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我作为一流人士，必须继续成长才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc84c9a8f5ddcaa94b3ebd8ec7e82d8bc7c9670d1790d578a7973c9c8366ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394ea3b3ee646695487879e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！圣王会持续进步的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ff383ff9cde2ee7ecba661b919cd2ec7790167b96f1404f590a8a6e57181b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc2d9044b074a50d5ddff358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，我就是圣王光环哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "060b0e40997b9960e18343e2a326a736ca62d2782e7c8f3a4b3e1b7801d8f821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9595ab18facd46c78172603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是变得更可靠了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e777fb9b47f896616008831adf1ae7af777e7a8ec27f1b812146695bc8fc18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e942a3fac393a76fc4917a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来增加支持的范围吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7429db11df8f15e972c5989c847b99aa12c00a6a0a36fa6df8d1cd8eb7489bd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443934a5e7de7b58f916ce29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想到一个好点子了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5792042dde54fb090a353f8e031a7756b255f03f9c3707a0aeae6060d8dbef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbc270bbca9e4005f9fd50d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要将那份期待\r\n全都化为力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1b717eb4038e4ee28b2bb1c03b50dafc64f20f9261a385382d6b49a4968f5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a5f1229dc87ff6c3c15151a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将赋予你因获得顶尖级声援\r\n而感激的权力。来吧，抬起头来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "700052c1ac1a3abae982b8d7a84158cf5be59327794c5497e7ebaedb2b7d5038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4466df165730c02aa810086e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王要登场了！来吧，准备喊口号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec7b8aef1ba6cf818a4fea95c922380fd69bf5dc82c2dfcca9dcbe42ebe6d43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70d33cf55cac3cd60c17f6cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成長を披露してあげるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd46d79a4529b4ec3216e044ade295a3b6d130647b198e30a3055a4f2e6ad874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2442b486865cc57c4c29c099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界の向こう側へ、門出の時よ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7fbc26600cda6110b7a728dfd62a1786e8664841283ddb0ed6ceb577364d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cc891b70517b5b220dca64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来なさい。栄光に向かい、\r\n共に歩む権利をあげる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "958ced8d0c44744e6b1dc061aa2e65d12a3ff3fb1c708ee228b82ea61ea595ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6af32ab66833bb7349ecd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングヘイローよ！\r\n共に一流への道を歩みましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0c9f41c9c75b0b2cb4120f28a860be6a97531250d2b50f0d053454b472a59e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f29d7693cd6f18b0be9cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bfbffc1bc9d1f595b2f80d07551bfd5f48273972e52bbe97e12d08f4c09c2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e04457a50f64a0edd942cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把『很期待今后』\n变成『今后“也”很期待』的～\n呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de378385e0ad1eb4029d22b1e5f0048981f54e1faeb8a71a8578acd7c573d839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f785ac69b782d6dba7ed51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb414975938f4e73045fdc24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbe6b06faa6a2d4f60fbe27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我的一切都挺普通的，\n但我觉得能跟训练员相遇的强运，\n一定是最特别的！尼嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb2f1a0e6693375b061ff85f1a41b066d2391f3c65becc03a7b00edca96a635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d155fb52d9bbd7b2f372fee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员累了的时候，\n我随时都会出现的！\n元气，元气的元气满满～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6858628115b9a6ce0766a16e8f64f97e0873f2f776e903234577fcf68cc3c38c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e331c2786b45e4398fc4ba5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\n说到新年的话，就不得不提年糕呢～。\n年糕ー糕年ー年糕糕ー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f7404fdca1a2a6339116cf572523ecdfb2498a70fd0731fd7207d134aaace78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c06344068e902d1dd5deb4de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在情人节专柜里看到了\n各种各样的巧克力…哈！？\n看入迷忘记买了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a05241386f4e19901cec8f43f1373853aa60f4848425832cec0a8b675335fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597de36ad0e61b1782391d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节手工做的巧克力\n…果然太普通了吗！？呜呜～\n但是，如果你能收下的话！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a102ab5baec9a8bdb59abc428fbbba44b4b5bbbaae852f27719c50eb6d0a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c14590b3a6048cfbe59d2240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿望，愿望…嗯嗯～。\n想许跟大家不一样特色的…\n啊！世界和平！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fb981c6d19ce8a2dcc316bca2fa4f051a9b2d704da8dcdc50f69ff75d8eb31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8beea4393dc2ea6a6c31d673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想扮成蜘蛛，\n所以做了八条腿…\n但好像变成章鱼一样了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "198583a4478a7394a9b6db4fa41c22c11da6e36427101c8f453ce5c049faa747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c68ef8d9fb991953ec21f693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是圣诞派对！\n购物清单写的满满的话，\n兴奋感也会增加哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3a4ac1408f3ebabbf9daab9470dd33571e050f01baf0f55ff70418d28c7220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dca65cbb777be2e684fa0c2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是圣诞节哦ー！\n兴奋兴奋。\n一起去看彩灯吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a958d0e733622101d44422000f3968e6582823ad1ff4a803041d432e881d06c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbaaf8c638c3fa5ec9d9854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，成功啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d7e22f5cda9dcdbca17ee72073334f69b9503e8072a1333d0c5e7c7fc92969",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6b363edf4d04eb34c2eea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢写贺年卡哦～。想着大家的脸来写的话，\n就会有种“哇哇～”的心情♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c99750df884c77ee4946acea064a667f6f8290a2dd6203bb719a990edb72ef4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49062623ba5482b8f51e5f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐！\n今天不管是揉肩还是搬行李，\n什么都可以帮忙哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e5ea497a128ecc00a57a578cfbac1e7240204704e2d635dae6b67402065879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd73d883beacfffb9adf6f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想给训练员一个\n特别的生日，啊…！\n有什么好主意吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "270b9e2ede0b68ed61ad9f46e95d0ae7b67266c8be56529ba0f876e66b330f74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752ebb349d205761e5ff168b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯呼呼…大家都\n给了我很多祝福～。\n生日快ー乐ー诗歌剧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c62bc1ab9040f3771f950b4cb1df8044095e944fd828038d201f527f15ffb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2e234a440ea939de38f485",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要祝贺我吗！？\n欸嘿嘿…从训练员那\n收到的『恭喜』是特别的呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29846349c996384f5f743d486b9adcf9b3d4bc33367c48c336431acf2b3202fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4557f9d71aa37269ac6dc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乒砰叭乓乓♪\n有通知哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f92509ed117c8921add076a43643e83c3fe347f219f091a198dd57a3d0475a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8daff0aefaf781afd5f6613a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，是礼物啊！\n嗯呼。不知道收到了什么的话，\n会心跳加快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ca2212096a4567ac2fb6863ef77bd58fe678e1e983f7c779675d14b8af1ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1100b8e4cbeedfe21878b9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成～！厉害！\n邦叭叭叭叭～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9928fda1e3d8f5c5eb6206f9772363ae675e044e55c635cce3fca68d97bb3a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32e205076ca2c70e3646439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说有活动举办哦！\n事先要先调查清楚\n才行～！便签便签！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2874915e9d4c3c59d460b50d3d089623ecc5063bd5ac7625f8f22899e86f292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ee33042fb4f6a18593e728",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！训练员，\n有活动在举办哦。\n真好啊，要去看看吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd7febea6decca810cee199440d5405dc3318decf44fd109ecd9d48bbeb4fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e389230187779c78a5b458",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜，不甘心呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b40d00f206b8bcb9b04943bda92f9c8a2d10e98bc02000c8e8f63894b820d1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251dbbfd5be8454aa846ac46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升！\n哪个哪个，去确认一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "015994d89f4fc58d1381d6a8452c8fd9a55b65207af7b5b2e3bedb0021b27730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32f1db70cf04717918b4bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子には自分で穴をあけてます！\r\nたまーにずれちゃうんですけどね～\r\n…ま、いっか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20179f21301cc661327ffd6223faa5182a6e1c91fd244553b7deb3310750dd5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ffea2edafbfcdf2733bb17c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お洋服は、その辺のお店で買って\r\nますよ～。ビビッときたらえいっと\r\n買っちゃう、マチタン流です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acfeedf68fce76ea57c0ce7af4bc0e006d806cb6d5db180661b7fe4bdb0d1aa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5ae40a6fcf1d37e8513332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボのお洋服っていいですよね！\r\n普通の私にはない感性で、\r\nなんだかちょっと憧れるな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3e1eccdd17ca163d36caa8ed09df83e21023ee6cee68614516f525b97723d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a898b612b5211831bca161",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很棒的胜利啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec61c11907f875dbb394763a2c61f2df14946302be33e72924488ca5d337092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4002fb0f03aa5bbf7b0b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇，厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3cacdb4dc7b61025f026ea5cac2c99c8f23579012c4bde286cefa73ed810d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3686467ad103f44ffd381105",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜，不甘心呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b40d00f206b8bcb9b04943bda92f9c8a2d10e98bc02000c8e8f63894b820d1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
